{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102563","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102563/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102563/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102563/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102563","id":2839269692,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6pO9E8","number":102563,"title":"Maybe I'm asking too much of \"match\", but what about type safety?","user":{"login":"nsalyzyn","id":274821,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDgyMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274821?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nsalyzyn","html_url":"https://github.com/nsalyzyn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nsalyzyn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nsalyzyn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nsalyzyn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nsalyzyn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nsalyzyn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nsalyzyn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nsalyzyn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nsalyzyn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nsalyzyn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-02-07T23:17:39Z","updated_at":"2025-09-03T23:39:06Z","closed_at":"2025-09-03T23:39:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.3.stable\n4.4.beta1\n4.4.beta2\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot 4.4beta2\n\n### Issue description\n\nI was looking to be clever with `match` to simplify some parsing. But, it appears you cannot add types to the bound variables. This can cause some warnings (which are defaulted to off) to trigger. It's a shame to have bound variables be less useful in strict projects. Although, some warning_ignore statments can go a long way.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI thought I was being clever with my \"match\" guidelines. My cheat menu allows me to type something like \"gem 5\" and it will call that specific line of code. However, it spit up all sorts of warnings around method access to Variant types that I couldn't figure out how to get rid of. You cannot assign a type to the binding pattern arguments. In this case, the type could technically be inferred from the Array[String] type going in!\n\nYou can turn on all GDScript warnings in your script to see it in the below content.\n\n```gdscript\nstatic func apply_cheat(cheat: String) -> void:\n\tvar regex: RegEx = RegEx.new()\n\tregex.compile(\"\\\\S+\") # Negated whitespace character class.\n\tvar results: Array[String] = []\n\tfor result in regex.search_all(cheat):\n\t\tresults.push_back(result.get_string())\n\n\tmatch results:\n\t\t[\"husk\", var husks] when husks.is_valid_int():\n\t\t\tprints(\"add a husk\", husks.to_int())\n\t\t[\"gem\", var gems] when gems.is_valid_int():\n\t\t\tprints(\"add some gems\", gems.to_int())\n```\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAny simple project.","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102563/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102563/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}